          <attvalue for="28" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="34" value="0.55" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Faster external arms deliveries and procurement financing redirect capital toward defense equities and away from safe‑income assets, producing net outflows from core bond allocations and a reallocation into sectors tied to military spending." />
