          <attvalue for="34" value="0.55" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Sharp increases in crude/oil prices raise electricity and cooling costs for data centers and shipping/installation costs for hardware, reducing the economic incentive to commission new large‑scale AI compute deployments and delaying capacity expansions." />
