          <attvalue for="28" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="34" value="0.7" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Heightened regional strategic rivalry drives global risk-off flows into US Treasuries and compresses the term premium as investors buy long-dated government paper, mechanically lowering long-term yields." />
