          <attvalue for="28" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="34" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Intense or unpredictable military operations increase counterparty and settlement risk, leading primary dealers and market makers to widen bid-ask spreads and reduce inventories, which materially reduces on-the-run Treasury market depth and turnover." />
